/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/float.k-30-  syntax Float ::= divII(Int, Int) [function, total, symbol(divII), no-evaluators]
/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/float.k-31-  rule divII(I1:Int, I2:Int) => Int2Float(I1, 53, 11) /Float Int2Float(I2, 53, 11) [concrete]
