/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k:20:  rule <k> Call(Fe:Expr, ARGS:Exprs) => Fe ~> #callee(ARGS) ... </k> [owise]
/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k:21:  rule <k> CV:Val ~> #callee(ARGS:Exprs) => #evalArgs(ARGS, .Vals, toCall(CV)) ... </k>
/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/call.k-22-
